<meta property="og:description" content="Local Ballot Measures
Election Day is Tuesday, November 3, 2026.
Register to Vote: You may register at any time, but to be eligible to vote in an upcoming election, your Voter Registration Form must be submitted online by midnight no later than Monday, October 19th, 2026. If you are mailing a Voter Registration Form, it must be postmarked no later than Monday, October 19th, 2026." />
